### 1. Get All Tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### 2. Create a New Task (Tests bodyParser)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 3,
  "title": "Master Native Node.js Middleware",
  "completed": false
}

### 3. Update an Existing Task (Tests PUT with bodyParser)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

### 4. Delete a Task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/3